# CosPiReflection: real reflection about pi/2.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/cos_pi_reflection.lit
# Before: failed in search_proof.
# forall x R:
#     cos(pi-x)=-cos(x)
forall x R:
    cos(pi-x)=-cos(x)
forall x R:
    0-cos(x)=cos(pi+(-x))
forall x R:
    cos(pi-(x+1))=-cos(x+1)
# Boundary: positive cosine, pi/3 in place of pi and complex inputs reject.
